5. Encrypt sensitive data at rest and use HTTPS for data in transit for data protection;
6. Suppress detailed error messages and implement proper logging in error handling;
7. Harden web server settings and apply regular security patches in server configuration;
8. Use virtual environments and process isolation in execution environment;
9. The response should be formatted in bullet points, with no code snippets.

